    "content": "<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">MEDICAID RESIDENTIAL ATTENDANCE RECORD</h2><p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;\">Provider (Family Caregiver and Host Home)</p></div>",
