    "content": "<div class=\"gform-instructions\">\n  <h2>How to Complete This Form</h2>\n  <p>This form tracks residential services and transportation provided each day of the month. Mark the days you provided services using the interactive grids below.</p>\n\n  <details open>\n    <summary><strong>Step 1: Enter Basic Information</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Month:</strong> Enter the month you are reporting (e.g., January, February).</li>\n      <li><strong>Year:</strong> Enter the four-digit year (e.g., 2025).</li>\n      <li><strong>Provider's Name:</strong> Enter your full name as the service provider.</li>\n      <li><strong>Person Receiving Services:</strong> Enter the full name of the client receiving services.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 2: Mark Residential Services</strong></summary>\n    <p>In the <strong>Residential Services Grid</strong>, mark each day you provided residential services:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Click on any date (1-31) to mark it with an <strong>X</strong> indicating service was provided that day.</li>\n      <li>You can also use special codes: <strong>E</strong> (Enrollment), <strong>H</strong> (Hospital), <strong>R</strong> (Respite), <strong>V</strong> (Visit), <strong>I</strong> (Ineligible), <strong>T</strong> (Termination), <strong>VT</strong> (Vacant), <strong>J</strong> (Jail).</li>\n      <li>The grid automatically saves your selections as you work.</li>\n      <li>The total number of residential days will be calculated automatically.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 3: Mark Transportation Services (If Applicable)</strong></summary>\n    <p><em>Only complete this section if you are an approved Non-Medical Transport Provider with Real Care.</em></p>\n    <p>In the <strong>Transportation Services Grid</strong>, mark each day you provided transportation:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Mark <strong>AM</strong> for morning trips to day program or work.</li>\n      <li>Mark <strong>PM</strong> for evening return trips.</li>\n      <li>Maximum of 2 trips per day allowed (one there, one back).</li>\n      <li>The total number of trips will be calculated automatically.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 4: Review Totals</strong></summary>\n    <p>After marking all days:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Review the <strong>Total # of days residential services were provided</strong> field to ensure it matches your entries.</li>\n      <li>Review the <strong>Total # of trips provided</strong> field (if applicable).</li>\n      <li>These totals are automatically calculated based on your grid selections.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 5: Participation Certification</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Name:</strong> Enter your name as the person certifying this record.</li>\n      <li><strong>Title:</strong> Enter your job title or role.</li>\n      <li><strong>Phone No.:</strong> Enter your contact phone number.</li>\n      <li><strong>Date:</strong> Select today's date.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 6: Submit</strong></summary>\n    <p>Once all information is complete and accurate:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Click the <strong>Submit</strong> button at the bottom of the form.</li>\n      <li>This form is <strong>DUE TO REAL CARE, INC. BY THE 22nd OF EACH MONTH</strong>.</li>\n      <li>Submissions will be sent to <a href=\"mailto:timesheets@realcarecolorado.com\">timesheets@realcarecolorado.com</a>.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n</div>",
